### ============================================================
### 6) LESSON SECTION FLOW
###    - Test CRUD section (KANJI / VOCABULARY / GRAMMAR / TEST)
###    - Cần token giáo viên/admin
###    - Chạy 01 → 02 → 03 trước (cần course + token)
###
###  SAU REFACTOR (V14):
###    - Lesson body chỉ còn { title, orderIndex } — KHÔNG còn lessonType,
###      contentMarkdown, durationMinutes.
###    - "Loại bài học" giờ được suy ra từ section đầu tiên / section TEST.
###    - Section TEST = bài kiểm tra / quiz (thay thế MINI_TEST ở lesson-level).
### ============================================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@teacherToken = {{teacherLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@studentToken = {{studentLogin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
@courseId = {{createCourseN5.response.body.data.id}}
### ============================================================
### 6.1) (Optional) Setup: tạo 1 lesson mới để test section
###        Nếu đã có lesson1 từ 03, có thể bỏ qua bước này
### ============================================================
# @name createLessonForSection
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bài Section Test: Hiragana nâng cao"
}

###
@lessonId = {{createLessonForSection.response.body.data.id}}


### ============================================================
### 6.2) GET — Lấy tất cả section của lesson (ban đầu rỗng)
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### ============================================================
### 6.3) POST — Tạo section KANJI
### ============================================================
# @name createKanjiSection
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sectionType": "KANJI",
  "title": "Phần 1: Chữ Hán N5"
}

###
@kanjiSectionId = {{createKanjiSection.response.body.data.id}}


### ============================================================
### 6.4) POST — Tạo section VOCABULARY
### ============================================================
# @name createVocabSection
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sectionType": "VOCABULARY",
  "title": "Phần 2: Từ vựng theo chủ đề"
}

###
@vocabSectionId = {{createVocabSection.response.body.data.id}}


### ============================================================
### 6.5) POST — Tạo section GRAMMAR
### ============================================================
# @name createGrammarSection
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sectionType": "GRAMMAR",
  "title": "Phần 3: Ngữ pháp 〜です/〜ます"
}

###
@grammarSectionId = {{createGrammarSection.response.body.data.id}}


### ============================================================
### 6.6) POST — Tạo section TEST
### ============================================================
# @name createTestSection
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sectionType": "TEST",
  "title": "Phần 4: Mini test cuối bài"
}

###
@testSectionId = {{createTestSection.response.body.data.id}}


### ============================================================
### 6.7) GET — Lấy lại toàn bộ section (giờ có 4 section)
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}


### ============================================================
### 6.8) GET — Lấy chi tiết 1 section (KANJI)
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections/{{kanjiSectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}


### ============================================================
### 6.9) PUT — Cập nhật tiêu đề + orderIndex
### ============================================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections/{{kanjiSectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Phần 1: Chữ Hán N5 (cập nhật)",
  "orderIndex": 1
}


### ============================================================
### 6.10) PUT — Chỉ đổi title (không gửi orderIndex)
### ============================================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections/{{vocabSectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Phần 2: Từ vựng mới"
}


### ============================================================
### 6.11) GET — Verify sau khi update
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}


### ============================================================
### 6.12) (EXPECTED 400) POST không gửi sectionType
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Section lỗi - thiếu sectionType"
}


### ============================================================
### 6.13) (EXPECTED 400) POST gửi sectionType không hợp lệ
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sectionType": "INVALID_TYPE",
  "title": "Section lỗi"
}


### ============================================================
### 6.14) (EXPECTED 403) Student thử tạo section (không có quyền)
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sectionType": "KANJI",
  "title": "Student thử tạo"
}


### ============================================================
### 6.15) (EXPECTED 404) GET section không tồn tại
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}


### ============================================================
### 6.16) (EXPECTED 404) POST lên lesson không tồn tại
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/lessons/999999/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sectionType": "KANJI",
  "title": "Section cho lesson ảo"
}


### ============================================================
### 6.17) DELETE — Xoá mềm 1 section (TEST)
### ============================================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections/{{testSectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}


### ============================================================
### 6.18) GET — Verify section đã bị ẩn
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}


### ============================================================
### 6.19) (EXPECTED 404) GET section đã xoá
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections/{{testSectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}


### ============================================================
### 6.20) DELETE — Xoá idempotent (gọi lại không lỗi)
### ============================================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}/sections/{{testSectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}


### ============================================================
### 6.21) GET full lesson detail (kèm sections)
###        Lưu ý: cần student đã enroll ACTIVE (chạy 04 trước)
###        Response có isEnrolled, sections[].sectionType, items, etc.
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
